    {
      "slug": "solar-system-all-done",
      "title": "Solar System: All Done for Now",
      "pages": [
        {
          "src": "pages/solar-system-all-done/01.webp",
          "alt": "Aldar's Solar System All Done for Now Finished for now, not forever",
          "bytes": 271874,
          "sha256": "2b7bfe0d0ca25db4c416abac85cf6365387ec5762d6e2c8e10b337eec630f5bf"
        },
        {
          "src": "pages/solar-system-all-done/02.webp",
          "alt": "I love the solar system. I like to look, move, and play. Aldar's Solar System: All Done for Now 2",
          "bytes": 201376,
          "sha256": "53967d231c653785b07c84001cd3362f30094778d388b80db27e80a04168eaba"
        },
        {
          "src": "pages/solar-system-all-done/03.webp",
          "alt": "Sometimes the solar system is ALL DONE. ALL DONE means finished for now, not forever. Aldar's Solar System: All Done for Now 3",
          "bytes": 246662,
          "sha256": "3d997363491998dcbcdd6a74a35d49aac654968c51f480f16b2f2da9bac82462"
        },
        {
          "src": "pages/solar-system-all-done/04.webp",
          "alt": "My teacher may say, Two more planets. Then, Last planet. Solar system, ALL DONE. Aldar's Solar System: All Done for Now 4",
          "bytes": 226526,
          "sha256": "7aa81fa4f95719d86b470fe88c4b451d4f9992aa28aaebb275091ee0a52e84d7"
        },
        {
          "src": "pages/solar-system-all-done/05.webp",
          "alt": "I can put away one planet. My teacher can help with the rest. Aldar's Solar System: All Done for Now 5",
          "bytes": 242652,
          "sha256": "71bdad4dbaec316ad5154023bd22fb64d2e60b3ade8ca41afe5ed1cd027b500a"
        },
        {
          "src": "pages/solar-system-all-done/06.webp",
          "alt": "I might feel sad or mad. That is okay. I can say, Solar system. My teacher listens. You want the solar system. I understand. Aldar's Solar System: All Done for Now 6",
          "bytes": 234486,
          "sha256": "e6d4a5d7498aa38aa5caa43a98fdbce49ad5a63ca39d209d2be7a06dadd1498c"
        },
        {
          "src": "pages/solar-system-all-done/07.webp",
          "alt": "Sometimes the answer is yes, later, or tomorrow. I can ask for HELP or a short BREAK. Then I can come back to my work. Aldar's Solar System: All Done for Now 7",
          "bytes": 213768,
          "sha256": "409268c55acc48166e70f6d43c2311fd52fe3a6c3df30a2522d5eb033159bf1e"
        },
        {
          "src": "pages/solar-system-all-done/08.webp",
          "alt": "Then I can do the next work. I can use three-part cards, read a book, or do a worksheet. I can come back to the solar system another time. Aldar's Solar System: All Done for Now 8",
          "bytes": 229624,
          "sha256": "4097ff2245f49066c1b61fca988ae286b9fbcd72af39a2d58a2bd4810dcb380f"
        }
      ],
      "cover": "pages/solar-system-all-done/01.webp",
      "original_pdf_bytes": 29498651,
      "kind": "social story"
    }
